Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:16.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That crazy rubber guy\Nbeat Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.24,Main-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I] Not even the marines\Nwere a match for Kuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man of a Thousand Plans!\NAnd this guy still beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:25.25,Main-207-,Pirate A,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] Just...\Njust who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only time a pirate should abandon\Nhis name is when he dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would never lose to a coward\Nwho ditches his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,betrays his friends,\Nand runs from life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:40.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Luffy... I never heard\Nthat name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should remember my name\Nfor the rest of your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause one of these days I'm\Ngonna be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES murmur]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:50.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And never come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:01.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:12.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya did good, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:19.80,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] I'd expect even you to collapse\Nafter what you just went through. Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:23.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why were you\Nso mad earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause I truly hate people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is not how\Nfriends should act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.40,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI] What\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it isn't.\NMost pirates aren't the brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,honorable people you always\Nmake out them to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:41.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want some meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.50,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,– [NAMI] You're unbelievable!\N– [LUFFY groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:55.51,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] Hey, guys, think you can keep\Neverything that just happened here secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? A secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would we want\Nto keep all this a secret?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:00.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Why, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We put our lives on the line\Nto save the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now everyone'll change\Ntheir opinion of you so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of being Usopp the liar,\Nyou'll be Usopp the hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHILDREN cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really, Usopp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to clear up\Nthis misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Misunderstanding...?\NI was known as the village liar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:20.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because I lied\Nall the time, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were right\Nto not believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:26.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Besides, there's no point in scaring people\Nwith something that's already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I seriously doubt\Nthat any more pirates like Kuro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and his gang will show up.\NThere's no reason for pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to attack our out-of-the-way,\Nlittle village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So listen up! Pretend\Nthis never happened! 'Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This was all just another one\Nof my great, big lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:47.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I won't force\Nyou to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No, I can do it! I'll do whatever it takes\Nfor the good of the village, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:53.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, too. My lips\Nare totally sealed, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHILDREN chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:05:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya... Will you...\NWill you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:04.99,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something just isn't\Nright this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It kinda throws everything off\Nif he's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:20.22,Main-207-,Little Girl,0,0,0,,[LITTLE GIRL] Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that screaming liar guy\Nnot coming to town today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.97,Main-207-,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN] That lying little twerp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't think I hurt\Nhis feelings yesterday, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He'll be up to his old tricks in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.40,Main-207-,Man,0,0,0,,[MAN] I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs] Thanks, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:46.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have been able\Nto protect the village without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give credit where credit's due.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:52.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you'd just stood by and done nothing,\NI wouldn't have done anything, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares about any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got my hands\Non this sweet, sweet treasure now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:05:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.51,0:06:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything that happened\Nhere today helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've just come to a very\Ndifficult decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:09.46,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Uh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:18.73,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Captain Usopp! What\Ndid you want to talk to us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:24.11,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] The three of you fought well\Nagainst those terrible Black Cat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As Captain, I'm proud of you\Nfor being so brave and courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we overcame\Nour biggest and most important
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:34.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,battle since we formed\Nthe Usopp Pirates five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That was when you three brave soldiers\Nwere only four years old. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:38.38,Main-207-,Children,0,0,0,,[CHILDREN] Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I know this is\Nsudden, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:43.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've decided that I'm gonna\Nset out to sea by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm finally gonna leave this place\Nand become a real pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At first, I wasn't sure\Nwhat I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:07:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't decide if I wanted\Nto stay here forever or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:03.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But once I saw them, I knew deep\Nin my heart what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel that, as a man,\NI must set out to the vast ocean. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I'm leaving this place behind!\N– [PEPPER, ONION, CARROT] Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I leave for one reason!\NWhen the great pirate flag beckons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you must heed its call!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.47,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Captain!\NSay it isn't so!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.47,0:07:26.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, ONION, CARROT panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lying again, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:31.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a bit hasty?!\NThere's no reason to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you loved\Nthis village!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what's gonna happen\Nto the Usopp Pirates without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.48,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] You've been\Nso good to me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I plan to leave\Nwithout telling the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give them my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Captain!\NJust stay here! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp Pirates.\NDo you remember this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is where we first met,\Nand formed the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing] Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:11.43,Flashbacks-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] Hey, it's\Nthat liar guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.14,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh?\NWho are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And why are you\Nso buddy-buddy with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, duh! You're famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:19.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're\Na really famous guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! I know,\Nyou've come face to face
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:25.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,with the man that is known\Nthe world over as Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, everyone in the village\Ncalls you Liar Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:28.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEPPER, ONION laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:29.91,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:33.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}'Kay! From this day forth, you're\Nofficially members of the Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:34.95,Flashbacks-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:37.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}C'mon! Man up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers] A lot's happened\Nsince then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:41.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[dog barks]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:45.80,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] A Cerberus!\NScare it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:49.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A dragon! Capture it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flour Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:54.26,Flashbacks-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,[PEPPER] You're\Namazing, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:55.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– [USOPP laughs]\N– [CHILDREN sigh]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:58.68,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] But of course! I'm\Na brave warrior of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please don't talk about the\Nold days! I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:04.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pepper's right!\NIt's much too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This kind of lie isn't like you,\NCaptain! It's not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would you say\Nthat you're going to leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:13.57,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] You're not\Nserious, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.66,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] You're being stupid,\NCaptain! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:20.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHILDREN cry]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, men! Tell me\Nwhat all your ambitions are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:30.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I grow up my dream\Nis... to run a pub!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My whole life I've wanted\Nto be a master carpenter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My goal is to become a writer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:38.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, swear to me now\Nthat each of you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:41.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will continue on your paths!\NPromise me that you will never
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:45.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,let the fires\Nof your ambitions die out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.98,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] As of today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,our group...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Usopp Pirates... [cries]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:02.62,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3230)}[USOPP] are disbanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:10.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that we've eaten,\Nwe should probably get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:14.51,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Here you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you all right\Nbeing out of bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.52,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:22.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think now I can\Ntruly start recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, my sickness\Nthis last year was caused
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by the mental shock of losing\Nboth my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:30.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And Usopp's friendship\Nhelped me start getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:32.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't stay in bed\Nforever, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:37.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a present for you\Nfrom the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:41.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to show you how grateful I am\Nfor everything you've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored\Nif you'd accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs] All packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:54.09,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Guess it's farewell\Nto this house, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.00,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunting] I\Ncan't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This stupid backpack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.03,0:11:32.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A real caravel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.88,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Are you actually\Ngiving this to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.80,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Mm-hm. As a token\Nof my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.64,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] It's\Na slightly older model,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I personally designed\Nit and she sails like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:51.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She has a carvel-make caravel with\Nlateen sails and a central stern rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:56.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's a fine ship,\Nand her name is the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:58.95,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Allow\Nme to explain the rigging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:02.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First, about the Kruger net yard\Nadjustment, it may seem a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! You'd be better off just\Nexplaining the technical stuff to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.38,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] What a cool ship!\NHave you guys seen the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've loaded it with all the provisions\Nyou might need on a long voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.63,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Thanks! It leaves\Nnothing to beat tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's "leaves nothing\Nto be desired", idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yelping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.64,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Uh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's\Nhe doing? Looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we'd better stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That weirdo, is on a collision\Ncourse with our boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Hey, thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:44.33,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] You're really doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:45.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take\Nto the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:47.20,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've decided to get going\Nbefore I have time to change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:53.54,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Please,\Ndon't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.46,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] I won't. I know\Nit's time for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, don't be sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just think, the next time\NI come back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:05.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about adventures that'll\Nsound more like lies than my old lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:11.69,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] You guys take care!\NI hope we meet again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Well... Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you antisocial\Nor something...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:20.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm taking off for life\Non the high seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:23.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I hope that we'll eventually\Nmeet again, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get on already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're friends.\NRight? So get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.38,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:38.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm really a Pirate Captain now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.76,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Don't be stupid,\NUsopp! I'm the Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:42.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO, NAMI, LUFFY laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.62,Main-207-,Carrot,0,0,0,,[CARROT] There goes\Nthe Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.04,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PEPPER] He fell in with some pretty awesome\Npeople, so I'm not too worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.79,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Yeah,\Nhe'll be safe with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\Nanybody as strong as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's always talked\Nabout becoming a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and now he's headed off\Nto live his dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:20.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know the villagers are gonna be\Nsad when we break the news to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our Captain was the only person\Nwho could liven things up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ONION, CARROT] What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:33.14,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] They certainly were\Na pleasant bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:34.14,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Merry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:35.56,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:37.94,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Lying hurts... A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.65,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Are you referring\Nto Klahadore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.53,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:45.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be talking\Nabout Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:48.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really wanted\Nhim to stay, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya. Years ago, one\Nof the villagers told me a story
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about your good friend\NUsopp's childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only a short time after his father\Nleft the village to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His mother, whom he was\Nvery close to, passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:09.01,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:14.14,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\t(3691,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}[USOPP] Pirates!\NPirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:15.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP panting] Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Dad's pirates are here\NMom! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:21.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hold on, Usopp, you\Nmustn't shout! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Mom, we're saved! Dad\Nfinally came back for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:29.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. There you go with\Nyour wild imagination again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:31.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true. He always said\Nhe'd come back for us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:37.25,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and take us with him\Nwhen you got better, didn't he Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:38.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:41.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Your father\Nwon't be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:48.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But... I'm proud to have married\Nsuch a brave man who dared to chase his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:50.64,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard about a special medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This stuff can cure\Nany sickness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.93,0:15:57.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So silly. You dream too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:16:02.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I am a dreamer! And I'm silly!\NIt's true. I'm proud of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm\Nthe son of a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Promise me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:11.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll grow up\Nto be brave, like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:22.00,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.88,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Perhaps out\Nof loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He continued to shout it\Nafter his mother passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:30.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the hopes that one day\Nhis father's pirate ship
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would be at the shore, ready\Nto spirit him away to the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:37.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and give him a family\Nthat he never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:46.07,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MERRY] The villagers say that his outlandish lies\Ncontain his most heartfelt wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:49.70,Flashbacks-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Pirates!\NPirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:54.62,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MERRY] As someone else who lost\Nboth parents, he saw you as a kindred spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:58.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he couldn't sit by\Nand ignore your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:03.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you too\Nto rise from the ashes of tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And live up to the example\Nthat Usopp worked so hard to set.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.64,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Cheers to a new ship\Nand a new crewmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL laughing, cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:24.65,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,[KAYA] They said\Nthat they were fighting to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:33.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Usopp's wild stories and outlandish lies\Nalways spoke of the joy of being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They helped me through my grief by\Ncheering me up and telling me to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.08,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,[MERRY] Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're really doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:41.58,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,[ONION] Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:42.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna follow\Nin our great Captain's footsteps!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL inhale]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:53.47,Main-207-,All,0,0,0,,[ALL] Pirates!\NPirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates! Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.93,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,{\an8}[KAYA] My life starts now,\NMerry. I'm going to be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:03.35,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MERRY] That's wonderful,\NMiss Kaya. Just wonderful.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=20}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
